    <unit id="DiagnosticsHint">
      <segment>
        <source>When something goes wrong, export a diagnostics package (zip) and send it to the developer. User names and the computer name are replaced; nothing is uploaded automatically.</source>
        <target state="translated">出现问题时导出诊断包（zip）发给开发者分析。用户名和计算机名会被替换，不会自动上传任何内容。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
